      "trueNode": "lightTimeRetarded_trueEclipticOfDate: h = r x v of the geocentric Moon (DE440s) at the light-time retarded epoch, node on the mean ecliptic of date (IAU 2006) plus delta-psi (IAU 2000A)",
      "chebyshev": "per record: interpolation at the n Chebyshev-Lobatto points (record ends shared by neighbours); verified at 24 equally spaced points per record. Planet/Chiron records within 3 deg of the Sun or above 0.5 mas: checked at 401 points; a record above 0.5 mas there is replaced by halved sub-records (<name>.refined.bin, same interpolation and n) until each meets it at 24 points"
    },
